{"4518240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Commie Bobrs", "steam_appid": 4518240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Physics-Based Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your friend's questionable guidance to assemble iconic  commie blocks from scratch without auto-alignment using cranes, ropes and other tools. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Workspace Bloody Hazards </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction site is a dangerous place. Fall from heights, get smashed by falling blocks, or get launched by an overloaded tire explosion. Did you know you need to clean up the concrete mixer sometimes?...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Cozy or Play Chaotic</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your comrades for a perfect build, or choose the chaos of 2v2 competition, where sabotage is an option.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive &amp; Construct</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the facility, repair your vehicles, hunt pigeons to survive the workday (but they can strike back!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build together with 4 friends or make a chaos in 2 vs 2 mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode - switch between up to 4 bobrs at any point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based construction;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school blood FX! (could be disabled in settings though);</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly nutritious angry pigeons.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Physics-Based Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2a3d5b530f41b20695e8b487ca3e17e.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your friend's questionable guidance to assemble iconic  commie blocks from scratch without auto-alignment using cranes, ropes and other tools. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Workspace Bloody Hazards </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/b2c6df3a4499f0f0c63ebacd278ce61a.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction site is a dangerous place. Fall from heights, get smashed by falling blocks, or get launched by an overloaded tire explosion. Did you know you need to clean up the concrete mixer sometimes?...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Cozy or Play Chaotic</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/783c8f59ab7b12644560971b4af2598f.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your comrades for a perfect build, or choose the chaos of 2v2 competition, where sabotage is an option.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive &amp; Construct</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.poster.avif?t=1783251410\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.webm?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/extras/2cc8b95664b983e7dc4d72eb1047d3a0.mp4?t=1783251410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the facility, repair your vehicles, hunt pigeons to survive the workday (but they can strike back!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build together with 4 friends or make a chaos in 2 vs 2 mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode - switch between up to 4 bobrs at any point!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based construction;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school blood FX! (could be disabled in settings though);</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly nutritious angry pigeons.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Commie Bobrs is a chaotic co-op physics-based building simulator. Assemble iconic Eastern Europe buildings block by block using cranes, forklifts, pure muscle power and your friend's questionable guidance. Just try not to die while doing it...", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/c040fa34d4678a3111bbd6ba3ffced95e003bd2a/header.jpg?t=1783251410", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/b7ce0f29367368adc6ccec15f30e2285ab3d1dfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783251410", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518240/b7ce0f29367368adc6ccec15f30e2285ab3d1dfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783251410", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8128 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><